  "method": "Actual shipped qa-c, real /dev/uinput controller devices and XTest input, isolated private Xvfb display 176, read-only GDB observations. No inferior calls or memory writes. World camera VIEWs require real DRAW commands; HUD views are not counted as player world viewports.",
  "root_cause": "SDL discovery used an enumerated device index as persistent identity and made a removed-device open error fatal. Removal also shifted survivors before the next loop index. The canonical admission path now uses the actual opened handle instance, follows it for virtual classification, tolerates only an exact removed instance, and rescans surviving indices. Real open errors remain fatal.",
